Campfire wasm patch 0104: ev_connection_changed in the wasm wallet API.

WasmWalletClient::ExecuteAPIRequest created the wallet API without the node
network, so V61Api::fillConnectionState had a null _network and
ev_connection_changed could not be reported (it throws). Pass the client's
NodeNetwork as wallet-api does; the call runs on the wallet thread after the
client has created it.

--- a/wasmclient/wasmclient.cpp
+++ b/wasmclient/wasmclient.cpp
@@ -510,6 +510,11 @@
                 ApiInitData initData;
                 initData.walletDB = m_Client->GetWalletDB();
                 initData.wallet = m_Client->getWallet();
+                // Campfire: without the node network the API cannot report
+                // ev_connection_changed (V61Api::fillConnectionState throws on a
+                // null _network). wallet-api passes it; this runs on the wallet
+                // thread, after the client created its NodeNetwork.
+                initData.nodeNetwork = m_Client->getNodeNetwork();
                 m_WalletApi = IWalletApi::CreateInstance(ApiVerCurrent, *this, initData);
             }
 
